; DDPCINTR.EXE: the Deluxe intro (pictures, fades, CD audio through MSCDEX)
; Hints for tools/disasm.py; numbers are hex.

exe DELUXE/DDPCINTR.EXE

; the segments, from the relocations, the header (SS:SP = 01AF:0800) and
; the debug SegMap (PALSEG holds four 768-byte palettes, see its names)
segment CODE   0000 CODE
segment PALSEG 0097 FAR_DATA
segment DATA   0158 DATA
segment STACK  01AF STACK stack size=800

; the relocation table lists only sites in CODE
relocorder CODE

; the bytes after the program image (CodeView NB08 debug information)
keeptail

; a word displacement 3Ah where the assembler takes a byte (not checked)
raw CODE:008F
